WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.833
Area and perimeter

2
00:00:03.633 --> 00:00:09.400
Father is covering the kitchen floor with square tiles. How many tiles does he need?

3
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:14.400
The floor has three rows with four tiles in each row.

4
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:19.500
Three times four is twelve, so the area is twelve square units.

5
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:24.433
To find the perimeter we add the sides: four, three, four and three.

6
00:00:24.433 --> 00:00:27.600
The perimeter is fourteen units.
